OL,3,CFilip Nowacki makes history with
OL,4,CEuropean Championships triumph
OL,6,FJersey's Filip Nowacki has secured a
OL,7,Fgold medal for Great Britain in the
OL,8,FMen's 200m Breaststroke Final at the
OL,9,FEuropean Aquatics Championships in
OL,10,FParis.
OL,12,FWhile many of his classmates were
OL,13,Freceiving their A-Level results, Filip
OL,14,Fdecided to keep his in the envelope to
OL,15,Ffocus on securing a podium spot.
OL,17,FThe 18-year-old swimmer had qualified
OL,18,Ffastest for the final with a time of
OL,19,F2:08.60, ahead of Austrian Luka
OL,20,FMladenovic.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/4
