PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F306A1786745077
OL,3,CFilip Nowacki makes history with
OL,4,CEuropean Championships triumph
OL,6,FHe improved on his time in the final,
OL,7,Fnarrowly beating Dutch Caspar Corbeau
OL,8,Ffor the gold medal by 0.08 seconds.
OL,10,FMladenovic secured the bronze with a
OL,11,Ftime of 2:08.91. Nowacki's Great
OL,12,FBritain teammate Gregory Butler came
OL,13,Ffifth.
OL,15,FThe Jersey swimmer had already placed
OL,16,Fsixth in the Men's 100m Breaststroke
OL,17,FFinal on Tuesday 11 August, just 0.01
OL,18,Fseconds behind Adam Ramsay-Peaty.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/4
