PN,30603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F306A1786745077
OL,3,CFilip Nowacki makes history with
OL,4,CEuropean Championships triumph
OL,6,FNowacki has had an immensely
OL,7,Fsuccessful year following the
OL,8,Fyoungster's victory in last month's
OL,9,FCommonwealth Games, where he won gold
OL,10,Fin the same event and silver in the
OL,11,FMen's 100m Breaststroke.
OL,13,FThose results made him the most
OL,14,Fdecorated Jersey athlete in the
OL,15,Fcompetition's history, with the gold
OL,16,Fmedal being the island's first since
OL,17,F1990.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/4
