PN,30604
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F306A1786745077
OL,3,CFilip Nowacki makes history with
OL,4,CEuropean Championships triumph
OL,6,FNowacki won the 100m and 200m
OL,7,FBreaststroke titles at the 2025 World
OL,8,FJunior Championships and collected
OL,9,Ffour gold medals at the European
OL,10,FJunior Championships.
OL,12,FThe swimmer also claimed seven golds
OL,13,Fwhile representing Jersey at the 2025
OL,14,FIsland Games in Orkney.
OL,16,FIn April, Nowacki won his first senior
OL,17,FBritish title in the 200m breaststroke
OL,18,Fwith a time of 2:08.52.
